# 基础词 Unit18
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit18核心词汇

{{eliminate}}{/ɪˈlɪmɪneɪt/}}v. 消除；淘汰}}{{The team was eliminated in the first round of the tournament.}}
{{else}}{/els/}}adv. 其他；另外}}{{Is there anything else I can help you with?}}
{{embrace}}{/ɪmˈbreɪs/}}v. 拥抱；接受；n. 拥抱}}{{The company embraces new technology and innovation.}}
{{emerge}}{/ɪˈmɜːrdʒ/}}v. 出现；浮现}}{{New evidence emerged during the investigation.}}
{{emergency}}{/ɪˈmɜːrdʒənsi/}}n. 紧急情况；突发事件}}{{In case of emergency, call 120 immediately.}}
{{emotion}}{/ɪˈməʊʃn/}}n. 情感；情绪}}{{She tried to hide her emotions during the speech.}}
{{emperor}}{/ˈempərər/}}n. 皇帝}}{{The emperor ruled the vast empire for many years.}}
{{emphasis}}{/ˈemfəsɪs/}}n. 强调；重点}}{{The teacher placed great emphasis on reading comprehension.}}
{{empire}}{/ˈempaɪər/}}n. 帝国}}{{The Roman Empire once controlled much of Europe.}}
{{employ}}{/ɪmˈplɔɪ/}}v. 雇用；使用}}{{The company employs over 500 people.}}
{{empty}}{/ˈempti/}}adj. 空的；v. 倒空}}{{The bottle is empty; please refill it.}}
{{enable}}{/ɪˈneɪbl/}}v. 使能够；使可能}}{{Technology enables people to communicate across the globe.}}
{{encounter}}{/ɪnˈkaʊntər/}}v./n. 遇到；遭遇}}{{We encountered several problems during the project.}}
{{encourage}}{/ɪnˈkʌrɪdʒ/}}v. 鼓励；促进}}{{The teacher encouraged the students to ask questions.}}
{{end}}{/end/}}n. 结束；v. 结束}}{{The meeting came to an end at 5 p.m.}}
{{endure}}{/ɪnˈdjʊər/}}v. 忍受；持续}}{{She endured many hardships during the war.}}
{{enemy}}{/ˈenəmi/}}n. 敌人；敌军}}{{The soldiers defended their city against the enemy.}}
{{energy}}{/ˈenədʒi/}}n. 精力；能量}}{{Solar energy is a clean and renewable resource.}}
{{engage}}{/ɪnˈɡeɪdʒ/}}v. 从事；吸引；订婚}}{{She is engaged in important scientific research.}}
{{engine}}{/ˈendʒɪn/}}n. 发动机；引擎}}{{The car has a powerful engine that runs smoothly.}}
{{engineer}}{/ˌendʒɪˈnɪər/}}n. 工程师；v. 设计}}{{The engineer designed a more efficient system.}}
{{enjoy}}{/ɪnˈdʒɔɪ/}}v. 享受；喜欢}}{{I enjoy reading books in my free time.}}
{{enormous}}{/ɪˈnɔːrməs/}}adj. 巨大的；庞大的}}{{The project requires an enormous amount of resources.}}
{{enough}}{/ɪˈnʌf/}}adj./adv. 足够的（地）}}{{There is enough food for everyone at the party.}}
{{ensure}}{/ɪnˈʃʊər/}}v. 确保；保证}}{{Please ensure that all doors are locked before leaving.}}
{{enter}}{/ˈentər/}}v. 进入；参加}}{{She entered the room quietly and sat down.}}
{{entire}}{/ɪnˈtaɪər/}}adj. 全部的；整个的}}{{The entire family gathered for the holiday celebration.}}
{{entitle}}{/ɪnˈtaɪtl/}}v. 给…权利；给…题名}}{{This ticket entitles you to a free meal at the restaurant.}}
{{entry}}{/ˈentri/}}n. 进入；入口；条目}}{{The entry to the park is free on weekends.}}
{{environment}}{/ɪnˈvaɪrənmənt/}}n. 环境}}{{Protecting the environment is everyone's responsibility.}}
{{equal}}{/ˈiːkwəl/}}adj. 相等的；v. 等于}}{{All citizens are equal before the law.}}
{{equip}}{/ɪˈkwɪp/}}v. 装备；配备}}{{The laboratory is equipped with the latest instruments.}}
{{era}}{/ˈɪərə/}}n. 时代；纪元}}{{We are living in the era of digital technology.}}
{{error}}{/ˈerər/}}n. 错误；过失}}{{There was an error in the calculation.}}
{{escape}}{/ɪˈskeɪp/}}v. 逃跑；n. 逃脱}}{{The prisoners tried to escape from the jail.}}
{{especially}}{/ɪˈspeʃəli/}}adv. 尤其；特别}}{{I love all fruits, especially strawberries.}}
{{essay}}{/ˈeseɪ/}}n. 论文；散文}}{{She wrote an excellent essay on climate change.}}
{{essential}}{/ɪˈsenʃl/}}adj. 必要的；本质的}}{{Sleep is essential for good health.}}
{{establish}}{/ɪˈstæblɪʃ/}}v. 建立；确立}}{{The university was established in 1920.}}
{{estimate}}{/ˈestɪmeɪt/}}v./n. 估计；估算}}{{The cost is estimated at about two million dollars.}}
